      "node_type": "kg",
      "content": "Major-General Sir Guy Campbell, 1st Baronet, CB (22 January 1786 – 26 January 1849) was a British Army officer, the eldest son of Lieutenant-General Colin Campbell and his wife Mary, daughter of Guy Johnson (or Johnstone). His branch of the Campbell baronets is referred to as St Cross Mede.",
      "depth": 0,
      "parent_id": null,
      "value": 0.1126006165399525,
